title: Wise People Say Write
pid: 66b91932-6326-4686-a7e5-fc0140abb3f0
body: |2-
  Knowledge mapping is [[id:d6fc1d5d-daa7-467f-b241-1a6d35431a9e][easier than traditional writing]], but it is, at root, writing.
